The '''Queen of Zygerria''' was the [[Queen|monarch]] of the [[planet]] [[Zygerria]] and its [[Zygerrian Slave Empire|Slave Empire]]. During the [[Clone Wars]], [[Miraj Scintel]] held the title.<ref name="Databank" /> In [[14 BBY]],<ref name="Tarkin date">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]'' dates the events of [[Tarkin (novel)|''Tarkin'']] to [[14 BBY]].</ref> the title was held by a [[Unidentified Zygerrian queen|Zygerrian]].<ref name="Tarkin">[[Tarkin (novel)|''Tarkin'']]</ref>

